@MongoTom:
Yeah, on the data. But *I* say the sun is just hot.

@TimezoneEnder:
Oh come on, the sun's down for us too? I hate this heatwave because my hair literally burns.

@MongoTom:
It’s the humidity, know. Low temps but the humps are screaming. If you wake up out there, you’ll feel like you’ve got a fever.

@TimezoneEnder:
Right, right. Just wish I could go back to the tropics.

@MongoTom:
Tropics are nice sometimes, but you gotta pay the bills somewhere. Will update if the temps spike higher.

@TimezoneEnder:
Don’t count on it. Just hoping the clouds clear tomorrow.
